          "title": "净土说明",
          "structural_unit_id": "aus-root",
          "content": "经典先建立一个可观想的清净世界，再引导读者把信、愿、行连成一条稳定路径。",
          "content_gloss": "The sutra first presents a purified world, then links faith, vow, and practice into a stable path.",
          "note": "Pilot paraphrase for Pure Land retrieval."
        },
        {
          "segment_key": "T0366-2",
          "position": 2,
          "title": "称名与忆念",
          "structural_unit_id": "aus-root",
          "content": "称念佛名不是机械重复，而是把散乱的心重新聚焦到愿力与忆念上，让修持有可追踪的节奏。",
          "content_gloss": "Reciting the Buddha-name is not mechanical repetition; it re-centers the mind on vow and recollection.",
          "note": "Useful for later retrieval of practice-oriented passages."
        },
        {
          "segment_key": "T0366-3",
          "position": 3,
          "title": "往生愿景",
          "structural_unit_id": "aus-root",
          "content": "修持的目标被明确指向往生与转化，而不是抽象的哲学判断，因此它适合做愿景与实践路径的样本文本。",
          "content_gloss": "The goal is explicit rebirth and transformation rather than abstract philosophy, making it ideal as a practice-path pilot text.",
          "note": "Closing pilot segment for the Amitabha Sutra."
        }
      ],
