        {
          "segment_key": "T0262-1",
          "position": 1,
          "title": "方便开门",
          "structural_unit_id": "lsu-root",
          "content": "佛以方便开示不同门径，目的不是制造分裂，而是让不同根器都能先入门、再回到同一方向。",
          "content_gloss": "Skillful means open different doors so varied capacities can enter and later converge on a single direction.",
          "note": "Pilot paraphrase for the Lotus Sutra."
        },
        {
          "segment_key": "T0262-2",
          "position": 2,
          "title": "归于一乘",
          "structural_unit_id": "lsu-root",
          "content": "声闻、缘觉与菩萨的路径在这里被重新编排为一种可汇流的整体，强调最后都能通向佛知见。",
          "content_gloss": "The paths of disciples, solitary buddhas, and bodhisattvas are reorganized as a converging whole toward buddhahood.",
          "note": "Important for cross-text doctrinal comparison."
        },
        {
          "segment_key": "T0262-3",
          "position": 3,
          "title": "授记与劝发",
          "structural_unit_id": "lsu-root",
          "content": "经文通过授记和譬喻鼓励菩萨持续精进，也让后续检索可以直接落到‘发心—修行—成佛’这一类结构。",
          "content_gloss": "Prophecy and parable encourage sustained bodhisattva effort and provide a searchable structure of resolve, practice, and awakening.",
          "note": "Closing pilot segment for the Lotus Sutra."
        }
      ],
